# TEMPLATE — copy this to `.env` and fill in real values.
# `.env` is gitignored; this `.env.example` is committed as documentation.
#
# Expo automatically loads any EXPO_PUBLIC_-prefixed variable and exposes
# it as process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_*. Restart the Metro bundler after editing.
#
# NOTE: anything with the EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix is bundled INTO the app and
# is extractable from the shipped binary — it is not a true server secret.
# Nothing sensitive belongs here.
#
# The Affinda key used to live in this file. It now sits on the backend
# (affinda.api.key) and the app posts CVs to POST /api/cv/parse instead,
# so the key is never shipped to a device and rotating it does not
# require a new app build.

# Base URL of the Treyo API for standalone builds. In development the app
# derives it from the Metro host, so this is only needed for EAS builds.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://treyo.leanconsulting.com.tn
